sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User browser
    participant A as Client app
    participant AS as Auth server
    Note over A: Create code_verifier,<br/>code_challenge = S256(verifier), state
    A->>AS: Redirect: client_id, redirect_uri, challenge, state
    AS->>U: Login and consent
    AS->>A: Redirect back with code and state
    Note over A: Check state matches
    A->>AS: POST code and code_verifier
    Note over AS: Verify S256(verifier)<br/>equals challenge
    AS-->>A: Access token (and ID token)
